OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start with a few
OL,6,Fshowers, which could be rather heavy.
OL,7,FLittle overall change through the day,
OL,8,Fwith perhaps the best of the afternoon
OL,9,Fsunshine across southern areas. Winds
OL,10,Feasing with strong winds near coasts
OL,11,Funtil mid-afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers merging to longer
OL,14,Fspells of rain, perhaps thundery,
OL,15,Fduring Wednesday evening and spreading
OL,16,Ffurther north and east. Chance of hail
OL,17,Fand lightning, mainly near coasts.
OL,18,FDrier later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
