OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FMostly dry start but
OL,6,Fcloudier with some showery rain
OL,7,Fspreading to western areas. Brighter
OL,8,Fwith some sunshine further east for a
OL,9,Ftime, especially towards London.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FTurning
OL,12,Fdrier and brighter during Friday once
OL,13,Fshowers fade. Saturday mostly sunny
OL,14,Fafter chilly start. Temperatures near
OL,15,For below normal. Mostly light winds.
OL,16,FCloudier with rain arriving through
OL,17,FSunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
